{
 "about": "Media query corpus for scripts/capture-media-data.ts. queries are evaluated (the device features MQ-R2 reads, on headless Chrome's desktop page at DPR 1); refusedQueries parse and serialise but Dragon refuses them (environment features MQ-R2 and MQ-R3 do not read yet, other units, non-finite calc, and a discrete feature in a range context, which Blink 145 accepts and evaluates ignoring the operator). A bandSheet with refused must be refused by band() and is not captured. fractional holds the MQ-R0 rows, captured at fractional media sizes. environment holds the MQ-R2 rows: each is captured on every listed device (a DPR, a desktop, touch or mobile page, and a reduced-motion setting, M7).",
